        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8521M, Retro Milano Lever with Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Milano Lever with Rectangular Rose is a beautiful lever that has will add a little retro flair to your home. This door lever is available in a huge selection of finishes, each one stunning. The Retro Milano Lever with Rectangular Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. And due to its ease of installation and the wide array of finishes to choose from, Emtek's Classic Brass Milano Lever with Rectangle Rosette is a great choice for any home remodel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Milano Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Milano Lever with Rectangle Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Milano Lever with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Milano Lever with Rectangular Rose is a beautiful lever that has will add a little retro flair to your home. This door lever is available in a huge selection of finishes, each one stunning. The Retro Milano Lever with Rectangular Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. Emtek's Classic Brass Milano Lever with Rectangle Rosette is a great choice for any home remodel.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Classic Milano Lever with Rectangular Rosettes, Milano Lever with Rectangular Roses, Emtek 8521M, Emtek 8121M, Emtek 8221M, EMT-8521M, retro levers, Milano Lever with Rectangle Rosettes, Traditional Milano Door Leversets,"
